#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/environment-variables.rst:2
msgid "How to use custom environment variables"
msgstr "如何使用自定义环境变量"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/environment-variables.rst:4
msgid ""
"If extra environment variables are needed in the build process, you can "
"define them from the project's :term:`dashboard`."
msgstr "若构建过程中需要额外的环境变量，可从项目的 :term:`dashboard` 定义。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/environment-variables.rst:9
msgid ":doc:`/environment-variables`"
msgstr ":doc:`/environment-variables`"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/environment-variables.rst:10
msgid ""
"Learn more about how Read the Docs applies environment variables in your "
"builds."
msgstr "进一步了解 Read the Docs 如何在构建中应用环境变量。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/environment-variables.rst:12
msgid ""
"Go to your project's :menuselection:`Settings --> Environment variables` and"
" click on :guilabel:`Add variable`. You will then see the form for adding an"
" environment variable:"
msgstr ""
"前往项目的 :menuselection:`Settings --> Environment variables` 并点击 :guilabel:`Add"
" variable` 。随后会看到添加环境变量的表单："

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/environment-variables.rst:15
msgid "Screenshot of the form for adding an environment variable"
msgstr "添加环境变量表单截图"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/environment-variables.rst:18
msgid ""
"Fill in the :guilabel:`Name` field, this is the name of your variable, for "
"instance ``SECRET_TOKEN`` or ``PIP_EXTRA_INDEX_URL``."
msgstr "填写 :guilabel:`Name` 字段，这是变量名，例如 ``SECRET_TOKEN`` 或 ``PIP_EXTRA_INDEX_URL`` 。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/environment-variables.rst:19
msgid ""
"Fill in the :guilabel:`Value` field with the environment variable's value, "
"for instance a secret token or a build configuration."
msgstr "在 :guilabel:`Value` 字段中填写环境变量的值，例如机密令牌或构建配置。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/environment-variables.rst:20
msgid ""
"Check the :guilabel:`Public` option if you want to expose this environment "
"variable to :doc:`builds from pull requests </pull-requests>`."
msgstr ""
"若想向 :doc:`Pull Request 构建 </pull-requests>` 暴露此环境变量，请勾选 :guilabel:`Public` "
"选项。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/environment-variables.rst:25
msgid ""
"If you make your environment variable **public**, any user that can create a"
" pull request on your repository will be able to see the value of this "
"environment variable. In other words, **do not use this option if your "
"environment variable is a secret.**"
msgstr ""
"若将环境变量设为**公开** ，任何能在你的仓库创建 Pull Request 的用户都能看到该变量的值。换句话说，** "
"若环境变量是机密，请勿使用此选项。**"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/environment-variables.rst:30
msgid ""
"Finally, click on :guilabel:`Add variable`. Your custom environment variable"
" is immediately active for all future builds and you are ready to start "
"using it."
msgstr "最后点击 :guilabel:`Add variable` 。你的自定义环境变量立即对所有后续构建生效，可以开始使用了。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/environment-variables.rst:34
msgid ""
"Note that once you create an environment variable, you won't be able to edit"
" or view its value. The only way to edit an environment variable is to "
"delete and create it again."
msgstr "请注意，环境变量创建后无法再编辑或查看其值。修改环境变量的唯一方式是删除后重新创建。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/environment-variables.rst:38
msgid "Keep reading for a few examples of using environment variables. ⬇️"
msgstr "继续阅读，了解几个环境变量的使用示例。⬇️"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/environment-variables.rst:41
msgid "Accessing environment variables in code"
msgstr "在代码中访问环境变量"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/environment-variables.rst:43
msgid ""
"After adding an environment variable, you can read it from your build "
"process, for example in your Sphinx's configuration file:"
msgstr "添加环境变量后，可在构建过程中读取它，例如在 Sphinx 配置文件中："

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/environment-variables.rst:47
msgid "conf.py"
msgstr "conf.py"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/environment-variables.rst:64
msgid "Accessing environment variables in build commands"
msgstr "在构建命令中访问环境变量"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/environment-variables.rst:66
msgid ""
"You can also use any of these variables from :term:`user-defined build jobs`"
" in your project's configuration file:"
msgstr "你也可以在项目配置文件的 :term:`user-defined build jobs` 中使用这些变量："

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/environment-variables.rst:68
msgid ".readthedocs.yaml"
msgstr ".readthedocs.yaml"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/environment-variables.rst:82
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"If you use ``${SECRET_ENV}`` in a command in ``.readthedocs.yaml``, the "
"private value of the environment variable is not substituted in log entries "
"of the command. It will also be logged as ``${SECRET_ENV}``."
msgstr ""
"若在 ``.readthedocs.yaml`` 的命令中使用 ``${SECRET_ENV}`` "
"，环境变量的私有值不会在命令日志中被替换，日志中同样记录为 ``${SECRET_ENV}`` 。"

